{"seq":2,"slug":"event-sourcing","title":"事件溯源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/message-queues-event-driven/event-driven/event-sourcing","wordCount":1678,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件溯源\">事件溯源</h1><p>传统系统存的是「现在是什么」——账户余额 1000 元，订单状态「已发货」。事件溯源（event sourcing）反其道而行：它不存当前状态，而是存「发生过什么」的完整序列——开户、存入 1500、取出 500、产生 0 利息……当前余额 1000 不是被存下来的，而是把这串事件从头加起来算出来的。这听起来绕，但在一类场景里威力巨大：当历史和当前状态同样重要时，事件溯源给你一份永不丢失、可任意回溯的真相。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事件溯源的存储不是一张可更新的状态表，而是一个<strong>只追加（append-only）的事件日志</strong>。每次状态变更都作为一个不可变事件追加到日志末尾，从不修改、从不删除既有事件。任意时刻的状态，由把该实体的所有事件按序回放（replay）得到。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    E1[AccountOpened] --&gt; E2[Deposited 1500]&#10;    E2 --&gt; E3[Withdrawn 500]&#10;    E3 --&gt; E4[Withdrawn 0 失败被拒]&#10;    E4 --&gt; RP[回放/折叠]&#10;    RP --&gt; STATE[当前状态&lt;br/&gt;余额 = 1000]\">flowchart TD\n    E1[AccountOpened] --&gt; E2[Deposited 1500]\n    E2 --&gt; E3[Withdrawn 500]\n    E3 --&gt; E4[Withdrawn 0 失败被拒]\n    E4 --&gt; RP[回放/折叠]\n    RP --&gt; STATE[当前状态&lt;br/&gt;余额 = 1000]</pre><p>用形式化的话说，当前状态是事件序列经过一个折叠函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 的累积结果。设初始状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、事件序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_1, e_2, \\dots, e_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>…</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_n = f(\\dots f(f(s_0, e_1), e_2) \\dots, e_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 就是函数式编程里的 fold/reduce，它决定了「遇到这个事件，状态该怎么变」。和传统 CRUD 模型对照，差异是根本性的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 CRUD</th>\n<th>事件溯源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储内容</td>\n<td>当前状态</td>\n<td>状态变更事件序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新方式</td>\n<td>原地覆盖</td>\n<td>追加新事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史</td>\n<td>丢失（除非额外审计表）</td>\n<td>天然完整保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当前状态</td>\n<td>直接读</td>\n<td>回放事件折叠得出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间旅行</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>回放到任意点即可</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么要这么做-四个独特能力\">为什么要这么做：四个独特能力</h2><p>事件溯源的复杂度不低，能让它值回票价的是几个其他方案很难提供的能力。</p>\n<p>第一是<strong>完整审计</strong>。日志本身就是审计轨迹，且不可篡改——每一笔变更连同时间、原因都被永久记录。这在金融、医疗、合规等监管密集领域几乎是刚需，传统 CRUD 要靠额外的审计表去逼近，还容易和主数据不一致。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>时间旅行</strong>。想知道「上周二下午三点这个账户什么状态」？把事件回放到那个时间点即可重建。调试线上诡异 bug 时，能精确重现出事时刻的状态，价值无可替代。</p>\n<p>第三是<strong>重建与衍生新视图</strong>。当前状态只是事件的一种解读方式。日后想从同一批事件里算出一个全新的统计维度，重放一遍历史即可——这正是它和 <a href=\"cqrs\">CQRS</a> 天然契合的原因：读模型可以随时从事件日志重建。</p>\n<p>第四是<strong>事件即领域语言</strong>。<code>MoneyWithdrawn</code>、<code>OrderShipped</code> 这些事件直接对应业务发生的真实事件，让代码和领域专家的语言对齐，是领域驱动设计（DDD）的理想搭档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快照-回放太慢怎么办\">快照：回放太慢怎么办</h2><p>天真的事件溯源有个明显问题：一个活跃了十年的账户可能积累几十万条事件，每次读余额都从头回放，慢得无法接受。解决办法是<strong>快照（snapshot）</strong>。</p>\n<p>快照是某个时间点状态的物化缓存。系统定期（比如每 100 个事件）把当前折叠结果存下来，附上对应的事件版本号。下次重建状态时，从最近的快照出发，只回放快照之后的少量事件即可。设快照间隔为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，则任意时刻重建最多只需回放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个事件，把回放成本从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    LOG[(事件日志: 10万条)] --&gt; SNAP[快照 @ 事件99900&lt;br/&gt;余额=980]&#10;    SNAP --&gt; TAIL[回放剩余100条]&#10;    TAIL --&gt; CUR[当前状态]\">flowchart TD\n    LOG[(事件日志: 10万条)] --&gt; SNAP[快照 @ 事件99900&lt;br/&gt;余额=980]\n    SNAP --&gt; TAIL[回放剩余100条]\n    TAIL --&gt; CUR[当前状态]</pre><p>关键原则：快照是<strong>性能优化，不是真相源</strong>。事件日志才是唯一真相，快照随时可以丢弃并从事件重算。这条原则保证了即使快照逻辑有 bug，也不会污染真正的数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最棘手的问题-事件演化\">最棘手的问题：事件演化</h2><p>事件一旦写入就永不修改，但业务在变——半年后 <code>OrderPlaced</code> 事件需要多记一个「优惠券」字段。你不能去改历史里那几百万条老事件，那么回放老事件时遇到缺字段怎么办？这就是事件演化（schema evolution），是事件溯源长期运营中最头疼的部分。</p>\n<p>常见应对手段有几种：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>向上转换（upcasting）</strong>：读取老版本事件时，在内存里把它转换成新版本结构（给缺失字段填默认值），日志本身不动。</li>\n<li><strong>弱模式 + 版本号</strong>：每个事件带 schema 版本号，折叠函数按版本分支处理，新增字段保持可选。</li>\n<li><strong>绝不删字段、绝不改语义</strong>：演化只做加法。要改语义就发一个全新的事件类型，老类型继续被老折叠逻辑兼容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种「只能向前兼容、永不回头修改」的约束，是事件溯源的固有成本。它和分布式系统里数据格式演化的难题同源，要求团队从第一天就严肃对待事件契约的设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时不该用事件溯源\">何时不该用事件溯源</h2><p>事件溯源是把利器，但也是把双刃剑，2026 年的共识是「明确需要时才用」。它适合：历史和审计与当前状态同等重要（金融、合规、账本）、需要时间旅行调试、领域本身就以事件来思考的场景。</p>\n<p>它不适合：简单的 CRUD 业务（一个后台管理系统用它纯属自虐）、强一致即时读取要求高（回放与读模型同步都有延迟）、团队缺乏处理事件演化与最终一致性经验时。把整个系统都改成事件溯源几乎总是过度设计——更务实的做法是只在少数几个真正受益的核心聚合（如账户、订单）上采用，其余照旧 CRUD。它常与 <a href=\"cqrs\">CQRS</a> 搭配，但二者是可以独立使用的，下一篇会把这层关系讲清。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>事件溯源存「发生过什么」的不可变事件序列，当前状态由回放折叠得出：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_n = f(s_{n-1}, e_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>独特能力：完整审计、时间旅行、随时重建衍生视图、事件即领域语言。</li>\n<li>快照把重建成本从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但只是性能优化，事件日志才是唯一真相源。</li>\n<li>最大长期成本是事件演化：只能向前兼容，靠 upcasting、版本号、只加不改来应对。</li>\n<li>仅在历史/审计重要、需回溯的核心聚合上采用；简单 CRUD 场景用它属于过度设计。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"事件溯源","id":"事件溯源"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么要这么做：四个独特能力","id":"为什么要这么做-四个独特能力"},{"level":2,"text":"快照：回放太慢怎么办","id":"快照-回放太慢怎么办"},{"level":2,"text":"最棘手的问题：事件演化","id":"最棘手的问题-事件演化"},{"level":2,"text":"何时不该用事件溯源","id":"何时不该用事件溯源"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事件驱动架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/message-queues-event-driven/event-driven/event-driven-architecture"},"next":{"title":"CQRS 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/message-queues-event-driven/event-driven/cqrs"}}